rosoft laid off last year 6,000 American workers. At the same time, the company benefited from 6,300 H-1B visas and almost 3,000 green cards. If you do the math, for every worker that Microsoft laid off, they replaced that worker with one and a half foreign indentured servants.\u201d\r\n\r\nForeign worker visa programs were intended to supply high-level talent to fulfill demand where domestic supply was short, but companies are abusing the system to undercut American workers with lower-paid foreign employees, according to the vice president.\r\n\r\n\u201cThere\u2019s this pernicious idea that Americans are not good enough for the jobs in their own country,\u201d Vance said. \u201cThis visa fraud is a frontal assault on the idea that you deserve to inherit the jobs and the positions in your own country.\u201d\r\n\r\nper EPOCH TIMES", "author": "Bullet3250", "created": 1791488246082, "profile_picture": "", "community": "TheDonald", "ad_tier": 2, "last_comment_author": "Mungo", "is_video": false, "video_link": "", "is_new_user": false, "domain": "", "is_crosspost": false, "preview": "", "removal_source": "", "link": "", "author_flair_class": "", "is_removed": false, "media": {"resized_resolutions": [], "blurhash": "", "full_resolution": []}, "title": "Microsoft, Adobe Suspended From Foreign Worker Green Card Program\r\nThe federal government will also probe nine universities over alleged J-1 visa fraud, the vice president said.", "last_comment_created": 1791493125087, "content": "<p>WASHINGTON\u2014Vice President JD Vance has announced that the Trump administration will suspend Adobe and Microsoft from a program that allows its foreign workers to apply for green cards and become permanent residents, citing alleged fraud.</p>\n<p>\u201cThere has been no company in the United States, unfortunately, that has abused this system more than Microsoft,\u201d Vance said in a press conference on Oct. 8.</p>\n<p>\u201cMicrosoft laid off last year 6,000 American workers. At the same time, the company benefited from 6,300 H-1B visas and almost 3,000 green cards. If you do the math, for every worker that Microsoft laid off, they replaced that worker with one and a half foreign indentured servants.\u201d</p>\n<p>Foreign worker visa programs were intended to supply high-level talent to fulfill demand where domestic supply was short, but companies are abusing the system to undercut American workers with lower-paid foreign employees, according to the vice president.</p>\n<p>\u201cThere\u2019s this pernicious idea that Americans are not good enough for the jobs in their own country,\u201d Vance said. \u201cThis visa fraud is a frontal assault on the idea that you deserve to inherit the jobs and the positions in your own country.\u201d</p>\n<p>per EPOCH TIMES</p>\n", "score_down": 0, "author_flair_text": "", "pro_tier": 0, "is_stickied": false, "is_nsfw": false, "is_deleted": false, "is_image": false, "comments": 2, "score_up": 19, "is_edited": false, "is_moderator": false, "awards": 0, "vote_state": 2, "link_metadata": {"status": 200}, "post_flair_text": "", "archive_id": ""}, {"is_locked": false, "tweet_id": "", "sticky_comment": 0, "is_video_mp4": false, "type": "link", "uuid": "1ATVaHzxYW", "is_twitter": false, "is_admin": false, "score": 18, "suggested_sort": 0, "post_flair_class": "", "id": 8876790, "raw_content": "", "author": "Moebius", "created": 1791489344321, "profile_picture": "0F9hm63l5dUw", "community": "TheDonald", "ad_tier": 2, "last_comment_author": "PROCIsAsshoe", "is_video": false, "video_link": "", "is_new_user": false, "domain": "redstate.com", "is_crosspost": false, "preview": "https://media.scored.co/preview/1ATVaHzxYW.png", "removal_source": "", "link": "https://redstate.com/terichristoph/2026/10/08/lincoln-return-home-to-san-diego-n2207900", "author_flair_class": "", "is_removed": false, "media": {"resized_resolutions": [], "blurhash": "", "full_resolution": []}, "title": "She's Home! USS Lincoln Returns After 321 Days and T